Abid ne kaha laash pe zainab ki yeh rokar aye Zainabe nashaad,<br>
Chalte hai mere dil pe ghamo dard ke qanjar aye Zainabe nashaad.<br>
<br>
Takleef sahi tumne madine ko bhi chorda, muh mujhse bhi moda,<br>
Wallah mujhe bhool gayi shafqate madar aye Zainabe nashaad.<br>
<br>
Allah ke nazdeek yeh rutba tha tumhara, khursheed na nikla,<br>
Quraan ke padhne me giri sar se jo chadar aye Zainabe nashaad.<br>
<br>
Humrah jo thi ap mere dil ko thi quwwat aye madane ismat,<br>
Is qaid me ab dekhiye kya guzregi mujh par aye Zainabe nashaad.<br>
<br>
Hai hai tumhe zakhmi kiya kambaqt shaqi ne, roka na kisi ne,<br>
Marne ko watan se tumhe laya tha muqaddar aye Zainabe nashaad.<br>
<br>
Pardes me sar par tha mere apka saya, aye Saniye Zehra,<br>
Baba hai na Abbas na Qasim hai na Akbar aye Zainabe nashaad.<br>
<br>
Jin bazuaon pe bosa Payambar ne diya tha wa hasrato darda,<br>
Bande gaye the woh rasane zulm se kas kar aye Zainabe nashaad...